00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:49.480
Chapter 11

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:53.720
All of a sudden waking up in a hospital&nbsp;
bed, Jin sits up and gasps while grabbing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:58.760
his previously fatally wounded chest. Panicked&nbsp;
and not really understanding what's going on,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:04.200
he just assumes everything that just happened&nbsp;
was a dream. Questioning if it truly was a dream,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:08.240
Jin turns to look outside and see’s&nbsp;
that he is indeed in hospital.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:12.760
Closing the door behind them, two random guys&nbsp;
enter Jin's room and make their way over to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:18.080
him! Wondering who they are, the man apologizes&nbsp;
for startling him while handing out his card.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:22.400
Seeing that it reads ‘Korean Hunter Guild&nbsp;
Inspector’ Jin asks why it is they came to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:28.560
see him. After a short chat, Jin is blown away to&nbsp;
find out he was unconscious for 3 entire days. He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:34.400
quickly asks about the current state of Joohee and&nbsp;
Mr Song and is told they’re safe. However, due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:39.400
Song losing his arm, it will most likely impede&nbsp;
him from his work as a hunter and he may need to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:44.880
retire. When it comes to Lee Ju-Hee, apparently&nbsp;
she is still being treated in hospital due to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:51.200
extreme trauma she faced. Right now its uncertain&nbsp;
if either of them will continue as hunters.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:55.760
Continuing, the inspector goes to talk about&nbsp;
Kim and the other 2 who escaped aswell, but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:01.680
Jin refuses to hear any more info. Obviously this&nbsp;
is due to how he despises the 3 people who chose&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:06.280
themselves over others and didnt even take the&nbsp;
time to think about what he might lose if he dies.

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:12.880
Its revealed that like we assumed, only 6 of the&nbsp;
original 17 members made it out alive. Being a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:18.400
hunter is an extremely dangerous job, still its&nbsp;
rare for a massacre like this to occur. Once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:27.920
the inspectors and white tiger guilds did reach&nbsp;
the scene, everything was gone. Instead all they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:27.920 --> 00:02:33.680
found was Jin lying atop the altar. No statues&nbsp;
or anything that the other 5 members described.

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:39.720
Blown away and unable to believe its&nbsp;
true, the inspector the same feelings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.080
he truly couldn't believe it either.&nbsp;
If it wasn't for the testimonies of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:46.960
everyone else who survived, or&nbsp;
if some of the deceased weren't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:51.360
found. The guild would’ve come to&nbsp;
a completely different explanation.

00:02:51.360 --> 00:02:55.840
Leaning in close to our boy, the inspector&nbsp;
says that this is all just a theory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.840 --> 00:03:00.400
however they all believe that he has&nbsp;
received the ‘double awakening’. Stunned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.000
and more or less confused with what&nbsp;
a double awakening is, Jin inquires?

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:08.680
So inside of Solo Leveling, when&nbsp;
someone awakens for the first time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:14.240
their power level is SET and it cannot move. On&nbsp;
odd occasions though some hunters get awakened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:19.160
again, after the first time. Through out the&nbsp;
last 10 years there has been a few cases of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:24.840
C-Ranks shooting to A, or B or sometimes&nbsp;
even going all the way through to S-Rank.

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:27.240
Placing the magical detector on Jin’s bedside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:27.880
table, the inspector explains that all Jin has&nbsp;
to do is place his hand on the mana crystal. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:31.880
inspector suspects that if like everyone&nbsp;
said, there were monsters with the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.816
to one shot people. Normal hunters wouldn't&nbsp;
be able to survive, only by getting A and S&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.816 --> 00:03:41.640
rank hunters would the situation have been&nbsp;
resolved. Still all the monsters ended up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:45.760
disappearing. To him it would just be&nbsp;
stupid to not suspect the possibility&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:51.920
of Jin-woo recieving a double awakening, as&nbsp;
after all he was the only one left inside.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:56.840
Sadly as the crystal finishes calculating the&nbsp;
strength of Jin, it reads back a power level of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:02.040
only 10. Depressed, the inspector thinks&nbsp;
that trash is trash through and through,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:06.200
like even the lowest E-Rank is a&nbsp;
70. Wondering what the result was,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:10.960
Jin is told that it looks as if they&nbsp;
suspected him for absolutely no reason.

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:15.320
Watching the two guys leave now, Jin a little&nbsp;
bumbed that he didnt surge up in strength,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.840
asks himself if the inspectors were aware of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.840 --> 00:04:22.320
thing. Looking up at his random screen he&nbsp;
assumes they mustn't be able to see it.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:26.720
What's weirder is that his torn off foot has&nbsp;
returned and the huge gash in his chest is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:31.960
all back to normal. Its hard to tell what was&nbsp;
a dream and what was reality. He guesses that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.960 --> 00:04:35.920
maybe he should have told the inspectors he&nbsp;
can see this random screen. Yet before he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:40.520
can dwell on his thoughts any longer, HIS&nbsp;
BANGING SISTER enters the room and asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:44.640
if his head wasn't hit aswell, cause wtf&nbsp;
is he actually doing pointing at the sky.

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:51.760
She asks him why it is that everyone else all&nbsp;
returned fine, but somehow he was the only one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:56.560
who got injured. looking at his sister raging&nbsp;
out at him, Jin cant believe he almost left&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:01.480
her... Speaking up he asks if she’s able to see&nbsp;
the screen infront of him? Not knowing what he’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:06.240
on about, Jin explains it like when there’s an&nbsp;
unread mail box in a phone game. Curious if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.240 --> 00:05:10.960
really did smack his head, she tells him that&nbsp;
well you’d first have to open the mail box...

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:16.520
Asking the mailbox to open, the screen infront of&nbsp;
Jin changes to now show him the unread message.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:21.680
“welcome player. Daily Quest; preparing to&nbsp;
become strong has arrived... Leaving for now,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:26.560
Jin's sister tells him she’s off&nbsp;
before gaping it with her mate.

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.960
Suddenly the screen starts&nbsp;
explaining to Jin that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:33.200
system will help the platers growth. Yet&nbsp;
if he fails to obey the systems orders,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.200 --> 00:05:37.200
there may be a penalty. For the&nbsp;
meantime, his rewards have arrived!

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:42.160
Not understanding a damn thing yet, Jin thinks&nbsp;
back and remembers the final moments from the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:46.800
double dungeon where the screen first&nbsp;
appeared. Getting another notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:46.800 --> 00:05:50.640
Jins see’s his daily request&nbsp;
and decides to open the message.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:55.280
Opening a directions screen now, it shows&nbsp;
that in order to complete the Daily Quest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:55.280 --> 00:06:03.840
Jin will need to do 100 push ups, 100 curl&nbsp;
ups twice, 100 squats and a 10km run. Oml I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:10.680
love how similar his quest plan is to Saitama’s&nbsp;
workout routine hahaha. There was this meme I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:19.040
saw yesterday that represented this moment&nbsp;
perfectly, ill try find it haha. Anyways!

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:22.240
Assuming this entire screen thing&nbsp;
infront of him is just a joke,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:25.520
Jin lays back down thinking that a&nbsp;
hospitalized person doesn't have the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:29.880
strength to do that! Instead he’ll&nbsp;
check it after he gets some rest.

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:35.200
With Jin asleep, time slowly begins ticking&nbsp;
away until all of a sudden an alarm rings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.880
signaling to him that he has not&nbsp;
completed the daily quest. Due to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:43.960
this it is now forcefully sending him towards&nbsp;
the penalty zone for an unspecified time limit.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:49.080
Slowly waking up to the sound of the alarm, Jin's&nbsp;
room suddenly begins shaking and the soft blue bed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:54.000
he was laying on, turns to stone, before then&nbsp;
turning into sand.... Sitting there looking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.000 --> 00:07:00.360
out over the desert plains, Jin panicked wonders&nbsp;
where the hell he is. Behind him a mound of sand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:09.960
appears but he doesn't hear it as at the same&nbsp;
time he assumes that this was all just a dream.

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:16.000
As the shade of the sand mound hits him,&nbsp;
his head snaps back to see a poison fanged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:33.360
giant sand centipede darting right at him.&nbsp;
Obscuring his vision, his quest directions pop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:39.270
up showing that this penalty is one he needs&nbsp;
to survive for a time limit of four hours.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:39.280
Chapter 12

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:43.760
Sweating and having pushed himself to&nbsp;
the limit for the past almost four hours,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:48.160
Jin sprints in a hope that the ravenous&nbsp;
centipede behind him doesn't catch him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:53.880
Bringing him a level of peace, the alarm rings&nbsp;
signaling that he only has 7 more seconds to go!

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:59.480
As soon as the clock hits 437am another signal&nbsp;
appears, congratulating him on completing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.480 --> 00:08:04.160
penalty quest. Jumping forth, Jin travels&nbsp;
through dimensions to fall back onto the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:09.160
floor of his hospital room absolutely&nbsp;
knackered. Looking up the screen once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:14.320
again changes asking if he would like to accept&nbsp;
his rewards for completing the penalty quest.

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:20.600
Unable to make a decision, Jin collapses from&nbsp;
exhaustion. Moments later a nurse enters the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:25.440
room and screams out in shock, wondering what&nbsp;
in the world just happened here! As she yells&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:29.040
out for someone to give her a hand, we see&nbsp;
that Jin is laying helpless on the floor,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:32.440
with a bunch of the deserts&nbsp;
sand dispersed out around him.

00:08:40.680 --> 00:08:58.080
The next morning, two nurses are seen&nbsp;
gossiping about Jin-woo. From what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.080 --> 00:09:02.240
they’ve heard he’s a hunter and even though&nbsp;
its only been a few days since he awoke,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:07.520
Jin has been running ever since. According to&nbsp;
the doctor this is because Hunters naturally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:12.800
heal faster than normal people. So light&nbsp;
exercise should be absolutely fine for him!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:17.360
Looking out the window, one of the girls&nbsp;
points out that even now he’s running!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.800
Since Jin first woke back up its been&nbsp;
4 days and in that time he was able to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:26.800
figure out a few things. Firstly, the&nbsp;
screen he can see is no an illusion.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:30.800
Although nobody else can see it,&nbsp;
its clearly infront of his eyes!

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:34.400
Having completed his daily quest,&nbsp;
the rewards tab is then shown,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:38.640
giving Jin a choice between 3 different&nbsp;
rewards. Choosing status recovery,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:43.520
out boy is suddenly engulfed in a healing&nbsp;
light. This magic is somehow able to heal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:47.840
the fatigue someone feels after exercising.&nbsp;
It doesn't matter how fatigued they are,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:52.080
it will make the person feel as if they never&nbsp;
worked out to start with. On top of that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:57.320
there are also stat points and random boxed items.&nbsp;
The player can increase anyone of their stats at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.320 --> 00:10:02.120
will as long as you have some stat points. The&nbsp;
more Jin adds to his character stats the stronger&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:08.400
he naturally gets. If he increases a full level,&nbsp;
it also buffs every stat overall slightly. He now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:14.000
has access to a status screen, skills screen and&nbsp;
inventory or item storage, its as if he’s playing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:19.040
some sort of game being controlled by a random&nbsp;
phenomenon. Sitting outside the hospital on one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:25.560
of the benches with a big smile on his face, Jin&nbsp;
curiously wonders what's even happening here.

00:10:25.560 --> 00:10:29.800
Later that evening, Jin makes his way to&nbsp;
the reception and asks if its possible to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:34.920
take a leave for today? Telling him its fine,&nbsp;
but still needing to now where he’s headed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:37.880
Jin explains that he needs to take&nbsp;
care of some business outside!

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:43.880
Making his way to HapJung Station level 3,&nbsp;
Jin stands above the staircase and readies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:49.000
himself for what he intends to do. Pulling out&nbsp;
a key and remarking that its time to find out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:53.880
what this thing does. We find that Jin got&nbsp;
this key as a reward from one of the boxes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:58.080
however this key seems slightly different&nbsp;
to the other ones he’s used at the hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:02.040
Instead of something that gives him&nbsp;
just bandages, this key has an item&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.040 --> 00:11:07.520
class of E and apparently allows the user to&nbsp;
create something called an instant dungeon.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:12.560
Quests, status windows, random rewards, Jin&nbsp;
assumes that this really might be all because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:18.520
of that silly old double awakening, or perhaps a&nbsp;
procedure towards gaining it! If thats the case,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:22.520
then he thinks its defiantly worth&nbsp;
trying! Most would laugh if they heard,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.520 --> 00:11:27.640
but the worlds weakest hero receiving a double&nbsp;
awakening seems plausible. After the previous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:32.760
4 days work, Jin feels confident in his&nbsp;
ability to run, so if anything does look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:37.400
like its gonna become dangerous. Jin's&nbsp;
plan is to turn and run no matter what!

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:43.240
Pushing the key forth and activating the instant&nbsp;
dungeon, a light of swirling blue energy appears&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:49.200
before him. Expanding in size almost immediately,&nbsp;
it opens a gateway into another world.

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:54.440
Unlike last time, Jin walks straight forwards&nbsp;
with no hesitation and makes his entrance into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:59.400
the instant dungeon. Inside now, an alarm&nbsp;
rings out signaling that he has entered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.400 --> 00:12:03.920
the dungeon. Turning around, his previous&nbsp;
plans of fleeing in the sight of danger,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:10.200
erode away as instead of an accessible&nbsp;
gateway, it has been sealed off.

00:12:10.200 --> 00:12:15.160
Banging on the exit to the dungeon, Jin looks to&nbsp;
his side to watch a random female on her phone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:19.680
casually walk through the sealed off gateway.&nbsp;
Confused because this is completely different&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:24.760
from the normal dungeons, Jin thinks that surely&nbsp;
it should be similar to the red gate. For those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:31.120
confused because we dont even get into what a&nbsp;
red gate is for like 30 more chapters, a Red&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:36.240
Gate differs from a normal gate in that it seals&nbsp;
off its entrance once someone walks through it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:36.240 --> 00:12:40.440
trapping the humans already inside the gate&nbsp;
and preventing anyone else from the outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:46.200
from entering the gate. This red gate will also&nbsp;
refuses to open until one of three things happen:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:53.080
the boss is defeated, the entire raid party&nbsp;
is killed, or a dungeon break occurs. Anyways&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.080 --> 00:13:00.760
thats enough for now, dont wanna get&nbsp;
to caught up on Red Gates JUST YET!

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:03.680
Trying to think of a different plan of action,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:03.680 --> 00:13:07.880
Jin's mind is interrupted as the alarm&nbsp;
sounds once more, telling him that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:12.400
cannot leave until either the boss is&nbsp;
killed or he uses the return crystal.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:28.480
Sweating balls and unable to think of a way ahead,&nbsp;
Jin feels an ominous aura emanating from something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:36.440
nearby in the darkness. Scared he asks himself if&nbsp;
he can really manage this dungeon without a party?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.360
Bang, so what do you all think? im curious on&nbsp;
what rank this dungeon may be. Its a blue gate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:44.080
thats had some glitchyness happen with it, if&nbsp;
it was like a red one it would have the same&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:57.840
stipulations, but it doesn't, but who&nbsp;
